From 4d4d8e956989bb96d1ed8aa2865c24b044ac52f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 20:42:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Implement 9/3 review pass
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add Contact page with mailto-based message form; wire studio email into
  site.ts and nav
- Replace site logo (Wordmark) with supplied emblem artwork; point
  structured-data logo at it too
- Home: new hero statement, consolidated intro copy, pillars/arenas
  section titles, studio blurb, bottom CTA
- Mythbound: hero eyebrow/statement, 4v4 mode kickers, systems lede
  (systems descriptions sync automatically via the shared pillars data)
- Studio: statement heading/body swapped in
- game.ts: status -> Alpha, Target Window -> 'Early Access Q4 2026 ·
  Release TBA', pillar/Relic Rush copy updates, Heimdallr -> Heimdall
- Re-centered all four Bound character renders (were off-center within
  their transparent canvas by 12-49px; recentered via bbox math, no
  cropping)
- Follow-on consistency fixes not in the original list but caused by the
  Alpha status change: Footer status row split into Status/Target Window,
  footer note, Studio project blurb and CTA, Mythbound status section and
  meta description, and roadmap intro all updated off stale
  'post-production' wording
